Example cast_parameter_value : cast_parameter 12 = 12.
Proof. reflexivity. Qed.
Example unknown_parameters_value : unknown_parameters 1 2 3 = 6.
Proof. reflexivity. Qed.
Example implicit_parameter_value : @implicit_parameter 4 3 = 7.
Proof. reflexivity. Qed.
Example dependent_parameter_value : dependent_parameter 1 eq_refl = eq_refl.
Proof. reflexivity. Qed.

Example short_cast_parameter_value : short_cast_parameter 12 = 12.
Proof. reflexivity. Qed.
Example short_unknown_parameters_value : short_unknown_parameters 1 2 3 = 6.
Proof. reflexivity. Qed.
Example short_implicit_parameter_value : @short_implicit_parameter 4 3 = 7.
Proof. reflexivity. Qed.
Example short_dependent_parameter_value : short_dependent_parameter 1 eq_refl = eq_refl.
Proof. reflexivity. Qed.
